Subject: [PATCH] cdfs: import the GTX kernel VFS namespace

The GTX vendor kernel exports filesystem helpers in the VFS internal
namespace. Declare the import so modpost accepts the CDFS module.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [GTX vendor kernel API]

--- a/root.c
+++ b/root.c
@@ -689,6 +689,8 @@
 
+MODULE_IMPORT_NS(VFS_internal_I_am_really_a_filesystem_and_am_NOT_a_driver);
+
 #ifdef OLD_KERNEL
 EXPORT_NO_SYMBOLS;
 #endif
 
 /******************************************************************/
